ur: open-source, platform-independent, community-supported software for describing and comparing microbial communities. Appl Environ Microbiol 75:7537&#x2013;7541. doi: 10.1128/AEM.01541-09.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1128/AEM.01541-09</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC2786419</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">19801464</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Huson D, Richter D, Rausch C, Dezulian T, Franz M, Rupp R. 2007. Dendroscope: an interactive viewer for large phylogenetic trees. BMC Bioinformatics 8:460. doi: 10.1186/1471-2105-8-460.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1186/1471-2105-8-460</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC2216043</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">18034891</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Trueper HG, Schlegel HG. 
