3;570 (2013).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">23892779</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Han P. &amp; Gu J. D. A newly designed degenerate PCR primer based on pmoA gene for detection of nitrite-dependent anaerobic methane-oxidizing bacteria from different ecological niches. Appl. Microbiol. Biotechnol. 97, 10155&#x2013;10162.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">24201910</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Kojima H. et al. Community structure of planktonic methane-oxidizing bacteria in a subtropical reservoir characterized by dominance of phylotype closely related to nitrite reducer. Sci. Rep. 4, 5728. doi: 10.1038/srep05728 (2014).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/srep05728</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4124587</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25098653</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wang Y. et al. Nitrite-dependent anaerobic methane oxidizing bacteria along the water level fluctuation zone of the Three Gorges Reservoir. Appl. Microbiol. Biotechnol. 100, 1977&#x2013;1986 (2016).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">26515563</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wang S., Wu Q., Lei T., Liang P. &amp; Huang X. Enrichment of denitrifying methanotrophic bacteria from Taihu sediments by a membrane biofilm bioreactor at ambient temperature. Environ. Sci. Pollut. Res. Int. 23, 5627&#x2013;5634 (2016).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">26578374</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wu M. L., Ettwig K. F., Jetten M. S. M., Strous M., Keltjens J. T. &amp; van Niftrik L.
