147, 315&#x2013;320 ((2013).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">23994967</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wang A. J., Liu C. S., Ren N. Q., Han H. J. &amp; Lee D. Simultaneous removal of sulfide, nitrate and acetate: Kinetic modeling. J Hazard Mater 178, 35&#x2013;41 (2010).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">20167423</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Daelman M. R. J., Van Eynde T., van Loosdrecht M. C. M. &amp; Volcke E. I. P. Effect of process design and operating parameters on aerobic methane oxidation in municipal WWTPs. Water Res 66, 308&#x2013;319 (2014).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25225767</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Jin R. C.
