75: 2046&#x2013;2056.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC2663196</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">19201974</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Watson SW, Bock E, Valois FW, Waterbury JB, Schlosser U. (1986). <i>Nitrospira</i><i>marina</i> gen. nov. sp. nov.: a chemolithotrophic nitrite-oxidizing bacterium. Arch Microbiol
